# Request
# Natural language description of objects to detect.
# Separate classes should be separated by periods (e.g. "a person. a car.")
string prompt
---
# Response
# All tensors including tokenized text and positional embeddings.
isaac_ros_tensor_msgs/TensorList text_tensors
tensor_msgs/ExperimentalTensor pos_maps

# Resulting list of class IDs
string[] class_ids
